NAME
    gcloud memorystore acl-policies - manage Acl Policy resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud memorystore acl-policies COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Acl Policy resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create aclPolicies.

     delete
        Delete aclPolicies.

     describe
        Describe aclPolicies.

     list
        List aclPolicies.

     update
        Update aclPolicies.

NOTES
    These variants are also available:

        $ gcloud alpha memorystore acl-policies

        $ gcloud beta memorystore acl-policies

